blurb = "Depicts a [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yamabushi]yamabushi[/url] (\"one who prostrates oneself on the mountain\"), a mountain ascetic hermit, heading for Myōgisan temple.

The hermit is accompanied by another person, who is listed as his servant. Allegedly, at the time such hermits could have acolytes or hired porters, and one of such people may be depicted here."
